{"unit_id":"ycr40__dsh-prolong-memory#card-zh","repo":"ycr40/dsh-prolong-memory","commit":"40d8085b08d043c856ae4e62b7dd309e5abb798d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prolong-memory 是一款 DSH 插件，为会话提供可检索的程序化记忆。它监听会话事件，将有叙述价值的事件整理为带序号和时间的日志段，异步写入会话工作区的 log.txt，并注入提示引导 agent 在回答历史问题前使用 grep 或 Python 检索。主要功能包括持久记录消息与工具交互、按配置保留日志窗口、提供 /prolong status 健康报告，以及统计涉及日志文件的拒绝调用。适合需要跨上下文压缩查找早期命令、结果和错误细节的 DSH 用户；无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:62-115","src/core/format.js:52-94","src/core/session-log.js:40-83"]}
{"unit_id":"ycr40__dsh-prolong-memory#card-en","repo":"ycr40/dsh-prolong-memory","commit":"40d8085b08d043c856ae4e62b7dd309e5abb798d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prolong-memory is a DSH plugin for searchable session memory. It records session events in each workspace log and guides the agent to retrieve earlier details with grep or Python. Configure retention and check log health or denied retrieval calls with /prolong status. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:62-115","src/core/format.js:52-94","src/core/session-log.js:40-83"]}
