{"unit_id":"ycr40__dsh-prolong-memory#feature-event-log","repo":"ycr40/dsh-prolong-memory","commit":"40d8085b08d043c856ae4e62b7dd309e5abb798d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prolong-memory 的功能「会话事件日志」：监听 session/event，将消息、轮次和工具调用等事件格式化为带序号与时间的日志段，并异步写入每个会话工作区的 log.txt。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:62-75","src/core/format.js:52-94","src/core/session-log.js:45-75"]}
