{"unit_id":"ycr40__dsh-prolong-memory#feature-window","repo":"ycr40/dsh-prolong-memory","commit":"40d8085b08d043c856ae4e62b7dd309e5abb798d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prolong-memory 的功能「日志窗口」：通过 logWindow 配置保留完整日志、最近 N 个段，或设为 -1 禁用日志；窗口模式写回被保留的段落。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/config.js:20-22","src/core/session-log.js:60-75"]}
{"unit_id":"ycr40__dsh-prolong-memory#caveat-window","repo":"ycr40/dsh-prolong-memory","commit":"40d8085b08d043c856ae4e62b7dd309e5abb798d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prolong-memory 使用 logWindow>0 时，窗口只根据当前进程见到的日志段维护；进程重启后内存窗口重新累计，因此保留范围暂时不会重建重启前的段。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/session-log.js:9-12"]}
